(* 2026-10-19 cold start (power loss): %MW are kept (Initialize %MWi on cold start = off).
   HMI_P holds the read-back of every SCADA setpoint; when its layout signature PSV_SIG matches this program,
   the setpoints are taken back from it (defaults above stay for the rest). A new download with a changed
   HMI_P layout has another signature and starts with the defaults. PSV_RESTORED shows the result. *)
IF NOT PSV_DONE THEN
